  <name>Bumpcap</name>
  <summary>Browse, install, and manage Linux kernels on Fedora</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Bumpcap helps Fedora users inspect installed kernels, find available
      updates, pin known-good kernels, record notes, and manage boot defaults.
    </p>
    <p>
      Privileged actions are handled through PackageKit and a narrow
      Polkit-gated helper for operations such as enabling approved COPR
      repositories and updating GRUB defaults.
    </p>
  </description>
